<article class="legal-en"><nav class="crumb"><a href="/en/">English edition</a> / Contact and Editorial Corrections</nav><p class="eyebrow">EDITORIAL INFORMATION · 1 NOVEMBER 2026</p><h1>Contact and Editorial Corrections</h1><p class="lead">How to submit evidence-based corrections and public technical observations about the edition.</p>{sections.map(([heading,body],i)=><section><h2>{heading}</h2><p set:html={body}/></section>)}<footer><p>This English page describes the same underlying project as its Spanish counterpart. In case of a material discrepancy, consult the original project documentation and request an editorial correction; neither version is represented as independently certified legal advice.</p><a href="/en/contact/">Contact and corrections</a></footer></article>
